2. **Evolutionary Role of [58]**: The text describes [58] as "further extended the notion" from [57], indicating it builds upon the earlier work. While [58] is part of the same body of work, it is less foundational than [57] and provides a secondary layer of context without introducing new assumptions that would alter the core claim.
