- **[57] (60%)**: This citation has the highest weight because it is the original source that defines the problem space and assumptions. It is the primary anchor for the entire discussion, making it more critical for grounding the claim about prior work. In academic writing, foundational citations typically carry higher influence in establishing context and scope.
